  "prose": {
    "summary": "Minimal CMS implementation structure consisting of one JSON data source, one renderer, one CSS presentation source, one Open Page Event, one Render Page Effect and one derived HTML output data surface.",
    "notes": "The example intentionally contains no site content or styling values. The page request, JSON document, CSS stylesheet and HTML document are explicit Data Properties so the modeled Open Page causal path can be traced without semantic guessing."
